#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui line 274
#: rc.cpp:140 rc.cpp:169
msgid "Regular expression to find the type of the element"
msgstr "तत्वको प्रकार फेला पार्ने नियमित अभिव्यक्ति"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui line 242
#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui line 282
#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui line 242
#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui line 282
#: rc.cpp:143 rc.cpp:172
msgid ""
"Regular expression to find the type of the element. The pattern is searched "
"on the result of the <i>DefinitionRx</i> match and the first captured area "
"will hold the element type.<br>\n"
"Example (simplified):<br>\n"
"<b>DefinitionRx=\\$+([a-zA-Z]+)=new\\\\s[a-zA-Z]+;<br>\n"
"TypeRx=new\\\\s([a-zA-Z]+);</b><br><br>\n"
"This will match strings like <b>$fooObj=new foo;</b>. Now this string is "
"searched and it will find <b>new foo;</b>, where <b>foo</b> is the first "
"captured text (the regular expression matching <b>foo</b> is between "
"brackets).<br>\n"
"So the type of <b>$fooObj</b> is <b>foo</b>."
msgstr ""
"तत्वको प्रकार फेला पार्ने नियमित अभिव्यक्ति । बान्की <i>DefinitionRx</i> को मिल्दो "
"परिणाम खोजिन्छ र पहिला ग्रहण गरिएको क्षेत्रले तत्व राख्नेछ ।<br>\n"
"उदाहरण (सरलीकृत):<br>\n"
"<b>DefinitionRx=\\$+([a-zA-Z]+)=new\\\\s[a-zA-Z]+;<br>\n"
"TypeRx=new\\\\s([a-zA-Z]+);</b><br><br>\n"
"यो <b>$fooObj=new foo;</b> जस्तो स्ट्रिङसँग मिल्छ । अब यो स्ट्रिङ खोजिने छ र यसलाई "
"<b>new foo;</b>, पहिला ग्रहण गरिएको पाठ <b>foo</b> (कोष्ठक बीचमा रहेको <b>foo</"
"b> सँग मिल्ने नियमित अभिव्यक्ति) मा फेला परिनेछ ।<br>\n"
"त्यसैले <b>$fooObj</b> को प्रकार <b>foo</b> हो ।"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui line 249
#. i18n: tag string
